OL,3,GNEWSASix things to know about Queen
OL,4,AMary 2
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe only remaining transatlantic liner,
OL,7,FQueen Mary 2, has reached a milestone
OL,8,Fwith its 450th crossing.
OL,10,FThe record-breaking vessel left
OL,11,FSouthampton on Tuesday on the seven-day
OL,12,Fvoyage to New York.
OL,14,FThe Cunard flagship is an echo of the
OL,15,Fgolden age of transatlantic liners from
OL,16,Fthe early part of the 20th Century.
OL,18,FBut how much do you know about its
OL,19,Fhistory?
